  "scope": "Fresh unchanged scalar Auto native, installed SDK, installed Python API and paired ImGui qualification on Windows and Linux. All original 362 API IDs remain within 396 passing cases per host. Current Windows observations pass four composed cases and 144 assertions against the existing composer. All 35 non-file-identity rules per context match the original contract exactly. Separate current contracts bind four fresh preference file identities; old producer/contract/expectation records remain unchanged. Composition contains 61393394 bytes under the unchanged 64MiB cap; full desktop executable/module bodies are separately pinned in product ledgers and excluded from the semantic composition input set. Native direct run and real CTest report both retain all64 names; CTest contributor uses its actual registered ID, without fabricating the old receipt. Raw Python envelopes use no terminal reporter. Preliminary count/import/transport/input-size setup refusals are retained; no product/test expectation change. Disposable venvs contain actual installed modules and use actual interpreters. Final retained products match those tested. Temporary assets are CRC/every-member-SHA archived before confined cleanup. This provides fresh runtime evidence only; historical source-freeze recovery, formal evidence registration and complete ImageJ/Fiji acceptance remain open.",
